  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health reform Novgorod</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sjukv&#xE5;rdsreform i Nov</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xE4;lsoreform i Ryssland med fokus p&#xE5; Novgorod och Chuvash. Sida finansierar TA till Novgorod f&#xF6;r strukturplan. Till&#xE4;gg har gjorts f&#xF6;r extra konsultinsatser, training samt koordinering med Chuvash samt federala komponenter med Moskva och V&#xE4;rldsbanken.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide support to a primary health reform in Novgorod oblast through the development of a regional restructuring plan for health services, an implementation plan and training activities for key stakeholders. The project is a pilot in a larger World Bank-funded Health Reform Implementation Project (HRIP) in cooperation with the federal Ministry of Health.</narrative>
  </description>
